Package: GRACE
Title: Enhancing gene regulatory network inference through data integration with markov random fields
Version: 1.0.0
Authors: Michael Banf
Maintainer: Michael Banf <michael@junkdna.ai>
Description: GRACE provides a probabilistic framework for characterizing metabolic gene clusters using context-specific gene expression information to facilitate a more comprehensive condition and tissue-specific functionality analysis of metabolic gene clusters. 
Depends: R (>= 3.4.3), reshape2 (>= 1.4.3), foreach (>= 1.4.4), doParallel (>= 1.0.11), netbenchmark (>= 1.16.1), Matrix (>= 1.2-18), ggplot2 (>=3.2.1), ROCR (>=1.0-11), 
License: MIT License
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.0.2
